WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Welcome to the sample short. This caption tests the burn-in.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.500
Machine learning models learn patterns from data.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.000
Supervised learning needs labelled examples.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.500
A neural network stacks layers of simple functions.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:17.000
Training adjusts weights to reduce the loss.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.000
Clip me into a vertical short and check the captions.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:24.000
End of the sample. Render me twice.
